ADDITIONAL NOTICE — NOT A MEDICAL DEVICE

This software is a research and educational project. It is not a medical
device, it has no regulatory clearance from any authority, and it has not been
clinically validated. Its outputs are model predictions on a fixed set of
narrow tasks, reported with their measured error rates, and they are not a
diagnosis.

Do not use it to make, support, or defer a clinical decision about any patient.

